{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% import "macros.html.j2" as m %}
{% block content %}
<h1>{{ page.title }}</h1>
<p class="lede">Talk rate at the institutions with the most abstracts.</p>
<p>Credit goes to every institution of the first author, or, with the toggle, of the senior (last) author.
An abstract can count for several institutions, so rows don't sum to the total. Institutions are resolved with a
hand-curated list of {{ n_institutes }} institutions, which places about {{ "{:.0%}".format(years[-1].summary.first_inst_coverage) }} of
abstracts. The figure shows the 20 highest talk rates among the 50 institutions with the most abstracts each year;
the tables list all 50, except any without a talk that year.{% if pooled %} For all years pooled, see the
<a href="index.html#all-institutions">overview</a>.{% endif %}</p>
{{ m.toolbar(years, basis=True, filter="Institution…") }}
{% for y in years %}
<section data-show-year="{{ y.year }}">
{{ m.year_heading(y) }}
{{ m.basis_figures(y.year, "institutions", "the 20 institutions with the highest talk rate among the 50 largest") }}
{{ m.by_basis(y.institutions) }}
</section>
{% endfor %}
{% endblock %}
